  m_text: "You may use the map to travel in the present, and anywhere you have already
    visited in the past. This is especially helpful if you, say, get stuck in a lake.
    Or fall off the map. Available waypoints will be light blue.\n\nUse the 'Switch
    Map View' button in the upper left corner to view the Past or Modern maps. \n"
